<concept id="t00105">
	<title>Tilt open or close</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>panorama sunroof
					<indexterm>tilt open or close</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00547">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00548">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_B03_004.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e00549">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i26_B04_028_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>Push the sunroof switch upward. The sunroof glass tilts open. If the power sunshade is closed, it opens.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Push the sunroof switch upward or forward when the sunroof glass is tilted open. The sunroof glass closes.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>To stop the sunroof movement at any point, push the sunroof switch in any direction.</p>
	</conbody>
